40:["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink-500 shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-white","children":["Validation"," "]}],"A single `lib/validation.ts` Zod module is imported by both the API routes (`safeParse`) and the React Hook Form clients (`zodResolver`), so front-end and back-end validation physically cannot drift."]}]]}]
